Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.25,0:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mayuri was still in elementary school
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}when her grandmother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She went to her grave every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even six months after her grandmother's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She always had her grandmother's \Npocket watch in her hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:04:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and she was always, always looking up at the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...like she was waiting for \Nher grandmother to come and get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then one day, there was a ray of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was the kind called Rembrandt lighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...or an angel's ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It felt like the light was drawing her up...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...like she was going to disappear...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let it take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be my hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use you for human experimentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The words that came out of my mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}were from some show I'd seen as a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mayuri and I had watched it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:06:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some mad scientist, screaming like an idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So Mayushii is your hostage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I can't go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you napping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost five.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going shopping, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll order pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't get the tropical special.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The time leap worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.79,0:07:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mayuri? Where is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii said she was going to Miss Luka's \Nto invite her to the party, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.05,0:07:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The development conference is canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done here for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you, go home now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,His phone starts ringing, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't answer the phone right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to leave a message—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing to indicate \Nthat the worldline changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's different from a D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really am back at 5:00 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bullet train!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the bullet train is white.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After this, Mayuri will return with Suzuha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I go to the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, who would believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That I've come from the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Three hours left...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.21,0:08:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oka... No, Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mayuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-She already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thirty minutes ago, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she was going back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't she get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:08:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so nice of you to \Ninvite me to the party, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she say she was stopping anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see her, tell her to call me right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If the worldline hasn't changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I don't do anything differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she should do what she did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyan-nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris can't answer the phone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need something—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that we were done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You time leaped from the future, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The second you answered the phone, \Nyou seemed to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,From the way you're acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can guess that something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...but I don't have time to give you the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Run? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get away from the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Tell Daru too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.19,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Ochanomizu—{that's a neighborhood name}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Mayuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She just invited me to your party—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn right, up there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, which way is Ochanomizu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to take Nae shopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask at the police substation{box}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you've taken her, don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! It's the first star!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was canceled. I told Kurisu and Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.51,0:11:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I asked Suzu to come too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and Daru was ordering pizza...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii doesn't understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You always do things I don't understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but today, I really don't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really want to \Ndo the experiment, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But just for now, can you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain the details later. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Mayushii just got scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rush hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one's on the platform...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the following lines have been shut down due to a bomb threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they don't know when \Nthe trains will start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, get to the subway now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing there for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Run as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina Mayuri was the one who died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Okabe Rintaro has been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1809)}Mayuri, I will save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I got word
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,that Mr. Braun is planning to return tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, did you do something again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:15:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done here for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was I too forceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It doesn't matter if I was acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For now, I just need them away from the lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't answer the phone right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why is it taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's going to end up like last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to find Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:34.20,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\frz20.104\fs75\blur3\b1\bord0\pos(1147.5,699)}Lukako
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako! It's me! Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oka... I'm sorry, Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mayuri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Mayuri there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just heading bac—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell her not to move until I get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she was going back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do as I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.69,0:15:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bullet train!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the bullet train is white.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to go fix Fubuki's costume
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and then go to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fubuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A cosplay friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She said a thread on the costume \NI made came undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got a message from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it's fixed, I'll go right to the lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll make it to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. The party...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The party was cancel—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it was postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.61,0:16:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't use the lab...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{It can't be helped.}...due to unforeseen consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wanted you to come with me for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Fubuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but save it for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're going away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,On a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can put Fubuki off until tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is very sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time to catch the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mayushii isn't ready at all, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Akihabara Station that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking the subway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a really long time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,since you dragged me along like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.09,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:59.45,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fs51\frx14\fry8\frz12.5\pos(877.5,129)}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:59.45,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\fs42\frz12.44\frx13\fry0\pos(894,168)\fax.1}Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:59.45,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.25\frx4\fry6\frz12.46\pos(484.5,471)\fax.075}Tell me later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My watch isn't working...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wound it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sobu line shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A bomb threat was called in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii has a lot of questions she wants to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's okay for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,when this is over, \NI want you to tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.31,0:20:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have that party sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.49,0:21:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to surprise her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.34,0:21:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, I {\i1}will{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...save you!
